## Execution
Runs: batch

After explicit user approval and successful `stage03_analysis.py approve`, submit `scripts/submit.sh` through `python3 <workspace>/_system/executorlib.py submit --workspace <project> <script>`, using the configured executor. Source `<workspace>/_system/gars-env.sh` and invoke the analysis with `$GARS_PY`. Request 1 CPU, 4 GB memory and 10 minutes where supported by the executor; expected runtime is under 5 minutes for this six-sample project and declared outputs should total under 5 MB. Resource estimates depend on the number of genes.

Write scripts, logs and results only within this analysis directory. If execution fails, record FAILED and report the actual error; do not change the method or retry silently. On success, run `stage03_analysis.py verify` to check declared outputs and generate OUTPUTS.tsv and STATUS, then append its returned history entry verbatim to project HISTORY.md as required by the stage contract. No computation or submission occurs while this plan is DRAFT.
